{"asset_key":"ep2/herohub_story_12411240","episode":"ep2","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"12411240","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1241124001:1":{"text":"I've been out to sea before, but this time just hits differently!","source_cn":"说实话，我也不是没出过海，但这次的冒险也太不一样了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2133A59622DC2899","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1241124001":{"text":"I've been out to sea before, but this time just hits differently!","source_cn":"说实话，我也不是没出过海，但这次的冒险也太不一样了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2133A59622DC2899","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1241124004:1":{"text":"Honestly, I haven't really gone far... mostly just drifting around near Rustport.","source_cn":"其实之前也没去过很远的地方……也就是在锈锚港周边打转。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x387AF0365DB96D5B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1241124005:1":{"text":"Before the sea monster appeared, the waters around Rustport were really safe, so I'd sometimes go out to sea when the weather was good.","source_cn":"那个触手海怪出现之前，锈锚港的海域很安全，我偶尔会在天...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01D4117F5EDC64F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1241124005":{"text":"Before the sea monster appeared, the waters around Rustport were really safe, so I'd sometimes go out to sea when the weather was good.","source_cn":"那个触手海怪出现之前，锈锚港的海域很安全，我偶尔会在天气好的时候出海转转。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01D4117F5EDC64F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1241124006:1":{"text":"Anchored trading ships, stranded caravans, adventurers learning to swim...","source_cn":"抛锚的商船，落水的商队，还有正在参与游泳训练的冒险家……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC0C17FC8767C808","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1241124007:1":{"text":"Aren't adventurers usually out searching for treasure or fighting monsters?","source_cn":"冒险家一般不都是在和寻宝或者和怪物搏斗吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x425AE4E72D7A7F90","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1241124008:1":{"text":"The waters around Rustport are clear and have few reefs, so many adventurers hold swimming competitions here to see who can cross the strait the fastest.","source_cn":"锈锚港的海域清澈，暗礁少，有不少爱好游泳的冒险家会定期...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74619B0A0339827D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1241124009:1":{"text":"Swimming shouldn't be taken lightly; it can be crucial for survival in coastal adventures.","source_cn":"别小看游泳，在靠海的地方探险，会游泳有的时候能救命。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24251B284EE71529","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1241124010:1":{"text":"Chippy knows this all too well...","source_cn":"满满这次就吃够了苦头……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60CB9C6BA8096030","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1241124011:1":{"text":"According to Sinbad, the waters around Rustport became dangerous only after the Dead Tide Fleet brought that tentacled monster.","source_cn":"听辛巴达的描述，锈锚港的海域都是从死潮舰队带来了那个触...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x48452B63BE3741D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1241124012:1":{"text":"That's right... I was attacked by that thing; the ship capsized, and I had to swim with all my might just to make it back to shore.","source_cn":"没错……我被那东西袭击过，船瞬间就被掀翻，我掉进海里后...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF3F142C39045FF2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1241124013:1":{"text":"Wow, after something like that, you still dare to go out to sea? You're so brave!","source_cn":"天呐，经历过那种事，你居然还敢出海，好有勇气！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA12F0A863DBC553","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1241124014:1":{"text":"Haha, I've got nine lives!","source_cn":"哈哈，我命大！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66726BE7E897075A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1241124015:1":{"text":"Even with the ship being forced onto that nameless island by the monster, we still had our share of adventure, didn't we?","source_cn":"虽然船被怪物拍到无名岛，但是我们不是也有一番奇遇吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E6419FA3EFD463A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1241124016:1":{"text":"I hope to keep bringing you luck in the ones to come.","source_cn":"希望接下来的冒险，我能继续给你们带来好运。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF2F781A6F2D7E48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:0:1":{"text":"Any unusual adventures?","source_cn":"有什么奇遇？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x13B79929BDA1519D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Any unusual adventures?","female":"Any unusual adventures?","variant_male_record_index":"66522","variant_female_record_index":"66523","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:1:2":{"text":"What have you run into?","source_cn":"碰到过什么？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC2BB1AD512F2FF8F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"What have you run into?","female":"What have you run into?","variant_male_record_index":"66524","variant_female_record_index":"66525","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:0:1":{"text":"Where have you been before?","source_cn":"之前去过哪里？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x226D20414FC412B5","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Where have you been before?","female":"Where have you been before?","variant_male_record_index":"66518","variant_female_record_index":"66519","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1241124002:1":{"text":"I can't quite explain... I don't know, maybe it's because this place feels more magical and dreamy.","source_cn":"说不上来……我也不知道，大概是这里更神奇梦幻。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFBAD785FF4EBF94A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1241124003:1":{"text":"So where else have you traveled?","source_cn":"那你之前去过哪里？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x401FCC2EC54B2FC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:1:2":{"text":"Why does it seem different?","source_cn":"为什么觉得不一样","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x88126A7BF15495BB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Why does it seem different?","female":"Why does it seem different?","variant_male_record_index":"66520","variant_female_record_index":"66521","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:辛巴达":{"text":"Sinbad","source":"辛巴达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"Chippy","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"Hammie","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":23,"localized_text_count":22,"speaker_count":3}}